{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53585","headline":"咏廿四气诗 小暑六月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 小暑六月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倏忽温风至，因循小暑来。\n竹喧先觉雨，山暗已闻雷。\n户牖深青霭，阶庭长绿苔。\n鹰鸇新习学，蟋蟀莫相催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}